J.1. Downstream eQTL Ablation on DNALONGBENCH
To provide a detailed quantitative view of our ablation study, we report the per-tissue AUROC results on the DNALONGBENCH eQTL tasks in Table S27. We directly compare DeepSeek-OCR with OpticalDNA under identical evaluation protocols. OpticalDNA consistently improves performance across all nine GTEx tissues and achieves a +5.37% relative gain on the overall average AUROC, demonstrating that our DNA-specific document formulation and pretraining yield more transferable representations for long-range functional genomics prediction.
